msgstr "Mashine"

msgid "Base32"
msgstr "Base32"

msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Lengo"

#, java-format
msgid "Continue to {0} without saving"
msgstr "Endelea kwenye {0} bila kuhifadhi"

msgid "You can browse to the site without saving it to the addressbook. The address will be remembered until you restart your I2P router."
msgstr "Mnaweza kutembelea tovuti bila kuiweka katika kitabu cha anwani. Anwani itakumbukwa hadi muanzishaji upya wa routeri yenu wa I2P."

msgid "Continue without saving"
msgstr "Endelea bila kuhifadhi"

#, java-format
msgid "Save {0} to router address book and continue to website"
msgstr "Hifadhi {0} katika kitabu cha anwani cha routeri na uendelee kwenye tovuti"

msgid "This address will be saved to your Router addressbook where your subscription-based addresses are stored."
msgstr "Anwani hii itahifadhiwa katika kitabu chenu cha anwani cha routeri, mahali ambapo anwani zenu zinazotegemea usajili zinahifadhiwa."

msgid "If you want to keep track of sites you have added manually, add to your Master or Private addressbook instead."
msgstr "Kama unataka kufuatilia tovuti ulizoongeza kwa mkono, ongeza badala yake katika kitabu chenu cha anwani kuu au cha anwani bina."

msgid "Save & continue"
msgstr "Hifadhi & uendelee"

#, java-format
msgid "Save {0} to master addressbook and continue to website"
msgstr "Hifadhi {0} katika kitabu cha anwani kuu na uendelee kwenye tovuti"

msgid "This address will be saved to your Master addressbook. Select this option for addresses you wish to keep separate from the main router address book, but don't mind publishing."
msgstr "Anwani hii itahifadhiwa katika kitabu chenu cha anwani kuu. Chagua chaguo hili kwa anwani unazotaka kuweka mbali na kitabu kuu cha anwani cha routeri, lakini hukuitiziki kuzichapisha."

#, java-format
msgid "Save {0} to private addressbook and continue to website"
msgstr "Hifadhi {0} katika kitabu cha anwani bina na uendelee kwenye tovuti"

msgid "This address will be saved to your Private addressbook, ensuring it is never published."
msgstr "Anwani hii itahifadhiwa katika kitabu chenu cha anwani bina, hii kuhakikisha kwamba haipochapishwa kamwe."

msgid "Base32 address requires lookup password"
msgstr "Anwani ya Base32 inahitaji nenosiri cha kutatua"

msgid "Base32 address requires encryption key"
msgstr "Anwani ya Base32 inahitaji ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi"

msgid "Base32 address requires encryption key and lookup password"
msgstr "Anwani ya Base32 inahitaji ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi na nenosiri cha kutatua"

msgid "Base32 address decryption failure, check encryption key"
msgstr "Kushindwa kuchifua anwani ya Base32, angalia ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi"

msgid "Generate"
msgstr "Tengeneza"

msgid "Encryption key"
msgstr "Ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi"

msgid "You must either enter a PSK encryption key provided by the server operator, or generate a DH encryption key and send that to the server operator."
msgstr "Lazima uweke ama ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi wa PSK uliotolewa na mtumiaji wa seva, au utengeneze ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi wa DH na kuutuma kwa mtumiaji wa seva."

msgid "Ask the server operator for help."
msgstr "Omba msaada kwa mtumiaji wa seva."

msgid "Enter PSK encryption key"
msgstr "Ingiza ufafanuzi wa usimbuzi wa PSK"

msgid "Generate new DH encryption key"
msgstr "Tengeneza ufafanuzi mpya wa usimbuzi wa DH"

msgid "Lookup password"
msgstr "Nenosiri cha kutatua"

msgid "You must enter the password provided by the server operator."
msgstr "Lazima uingize nenosiri ulichopewa na mtumiaji wa seva."

msgid "HTTP Outproxy"
msgstr "Outproxy ya HTTP"

