msgid "This will add an alternate destination for {0}"
msgstr "Hii itaongeza lengo mbadala kwa {0}"

msgid "Authentication for adding subdomain"
msgstr "Uthibitisho wa kuongeza subdomaini"

#, java-format
msgid "This will add a subdomain {0} of {1}, with a different destination"
msgstr "Hii itaongeza subdomaini {0} ya {1}, yenye lengo tofauti"

msgid "This tunnel must be configured with the new subdomain and destination."
msgstr "Tuneli hii lazima isanidiwe kwa subdomaini jipya na lengo jipya."

msgid "Enter higher-level domain and destination below."
msgstr "Ingiza domaini ya kiwango cha juu na lengo hapa chini."

msgid "Return to Tunnel Configuration"
msgstr "Rudi kwenye Mipangilio ya Tuneli"

msgid "Specify old name and destination"
msgstr "Weka jina la awali na lengo"

msgid "This is only required for advanced authentication."
msgstr "Hii inahitajika tu kwa uthibitisho wa juu."

msgid "See above for required items."
msgstr "Tazama hapa juu kwa vitu vinavyohitajika."

msgid "Old / parent hostname "
msgstr "Jina la mashine la awali / la mzazi "

msgid "Private key file for old destination / sub-domain parent"
msgstr "Faili ya ufafanuzi bina ya lengo la awali / mzazi wa subdomaini"

msgid "Generate Authentication"
msgstr "Tengeneza Uthibitisho"

msgid "SSL Helper"
msgstr "Msaidia wa SSL"

msgid "Experts only!"
msgstr "Wa wataalamu tu!"

msgid "Alt Base32"
msgstr "Base32 Mbadala"

msgid "Incoming I2P Port Routing"
msgstr "Usambazaji wa Bandari Zinazoingia za I2P"

msgid "Virtual Host"
msgstr "Mashine Virtuali"

msgid "Via SSL?"
msgstr "Kupitia SSL?"

msgid "Test HTTPS server through I2P"
msgstr "Jaribu seva ya HTTPS kupitia I2P"

msgid "Server"
msgstr "Seva"

msgid "SSL Activation"
msgstr "Uanzishaji wa SSL"

msgid "I2P webserver (eepsite)"
msgstr "Seva ya tovuti ya I2P (eepsite)"

msgid "Disable SSL"
msgstr "Zima SSL"

msgid "Enable SSL"
msgstr "Washa SSL"

msgid "New Certificate Password"
msgstr "Nenosiri Jipya la Cheti"

msgid "Password (required to encrypt the certificate)"
msgstr "Nenosiri (inahitajika ili kusimbuza cheti)"

msgid "Generate new SSL certificate"
msgstr "Tengeneza cheti mpya cha SSL"

msgid "Generate SSL certificate and enable"
msgstr "Tengeneza cheti cha SSL na uwashe"

#, java-format
msgid "Cannot configure, no Jetty server found in {0}client configurations{1} that matches this tunnel"
msgstr "Haiwezekani kusanidi, hakuna seva ya Jetty iliyopatikana katika {0}mipangilio ya wateja{1} zinayolingana na tuneli hii"

msgid "Support for non-Jetty servers will be added in a future release"
msgstr "Msaada wa seva zisizo za Jetty utaongezwa katika tobao lijalo"

msgid "Return to Tunnel Manager Index"
msgstr "Rudi kwenye Ukurasa wa Nyumbari wa Msimamizi wa Tuneli"

msgid "Return to Tunnel Editor"
msgstr "Rudi kwenye Mhariri wa Tuneli"

msgid "I2P Tunnel Manager - Tunnel Creation Wizard"
msgstr "Msimamizi wa Tuneli wa I2P - Mwongoza wa Kutengeneza Tuneli"

msgid "Server or client tunnel?"
msgstr "Tuneli ya seva au ya mteja?"

msgid "Tunnel type"
msgstr "Aina ya tuneli"

msgid "Tunnel name and description"
msgstr "Jina na maelezo ya tuneli"

msgid "Tunnel destination"
msgstr "Lengo la tuneli"

msgid "Binding address and port"
msgstr "Anwani ya kujaza na bandari"

msgid "Tunnel auto-start"
msgstr "Anza kiotomatiki tuneli"

msgid "Wizard completed"
msgstr "Mwongoza umekamilika"

msgid "This wizard will take you through the various options available for creating tunnels in I2P."
msgstr "Mwongoza huu utakuongoza kupitia vichaguo mbalimbali vinavyopatikana vya kutengeneza tuneli ndani ya I2P."

msgid "The first thing to decide is whether you want to create a server or a client tunnel."
msgstr "Jambo la kwanza la kuamua ni kama unataka kutengeneza tuneli ya seva au ya mteja."

msgid "If you need to connect to a remote service, such as an IRC server inside I2P or a code repository, then you will require a CLIENT tunnel."
msgstr "Kama unahitaji kuunganisha kwa huduma ya mbali, kama seva ya IRC ndani ya I2P au kanzidata ya msimbo, basi utahitaji tuneli ya MTETJA."

msgid "On the other hand, if you wish to host a service for others to connect to you'll need to create a SERVER tunnel."
msgstr "Kwa upande mwingine, kama unataka kuhosti huduma ili wengine waunganishe naye, utahitaji kutengeneza tuneli ya SEVA."

msgid "Server Tunnel"
msgstr "Tuneli ya Seva"

msgid "Client Tunnel"
msgstr "Tuneli ya Mteja"

msgid "There are several types of tunnels to choose from:"
msgstr "Kuna aina mbalimbali za tuneli zinazoziwa kuchagua:"

msgid "Basic tunnel for connecting to a single service inside I2P."
msgstr "Tuneli ya msingi ya kuunganisha kwa huduma moja ndani ya I2P."

msgid "Try this if none of the tunnel types below fit your requirements, or you don't know what type of tunnel you need."
msgstr "Jaribu hii kama hakuna aina ya tuneli hapa chini inayolingana na mahitaji yako, au kama huna jinsi ya aina ya tuneli inayohitaji."

msgid "Tunnel that acts as an HTTP proxy for reaching eepsites inside I2P."
msgstr "Tuneli inayofanya kazi kama proksi ya HTTP kufikia eepsites ndani ya I2P."

msgid "Set your browser to use this tunnel as an http proxy, or set your \"http_proxy\" environment variable for command-line applications in GNU/Linux."
msgstr "Weka kivinjari chenu kutumia tuneli hii kama proksi ya http, au weka kiambishi chako cha mazingira \"http_proxy\" kwa programu za mstari wa amri katika GNU/Linux."

msgid "Websites outside I2P can also be reached if an HTTP proxy within I2P is known."
msgstr "Tovuti nje ya I2P pia zinaweza kufikiliwa kama proksi ya HTTP ndani ya I2P inajulikana."

msgid "Customised client tunnel specific for IRC connections."
msgstr "Tuneli ya mteja iliyobadilishwa kwa ajili ya muunganisho wa IRC."

msgid "With this tunnel type, your IRC client will be able to connect to an IRC network inside I2P."
msgstr "Kwa aina hii ya tuneli, mteja wako wa IRC utaweza kuunganisha kwenye mtandao wa IRC ndani ya I2P."

msgid "Each IRC network in I2P that you wish to connect to will require its own tunnel. (See Also, SOCKS IRC)"
msgstr "Kila mtandao wa IRC ndani ya I2P unaotaka kuunganishwa utahitaji tuneli yake. (Angalia pia, IRC ya SOCKS)"

msgid "A tunnel that implements the SOCKS protocol."
msgstr "Tuneli inayotekeleza itaratibu ya SOCKS."

msgid "This enables both TCP and UDP connections to be made through a SOCKS outproxy within I2P."
msgstr "Hii inaruhusu muunganisho wote wa TCP na UDP kufanywa kupitia outproxy ya SOCKS ndani ya I2P."

msgid "A client tunnel implementing the SOCKS protocol, which is customised for connecting to IRC networks."
msgstr "Tuneli ya mteja inayotekeleza itaratibu ya SOCKS, iliyobadilishwa kwa ajili ya kuunganisha kwa mitandao ya IRC."

msgid "With this tunnel type, IRC networks in I2P can be reached by typing the I2P address into your IRC client, and configuring the IRC client to use this SOCKS tunnel."
msgstr "Kwa aina hii ya tuneli, mitandao ya IRC ndani ya I2P inaweza kufikiliwa kwa kuandika anwani ya I2P kwenye mteja wako wa IRC, na kusanidi mteja wa IRC kutumia tuneli hii ya SOCKS."

msgid "This means that only one I2P tunnel is required rather than a separate tunnel per IRC network."
msgstr "Hii inaamaanisha kwamba tuneli moja tu ya I2P inahitajika badala ya tuneli tofauti kwa kila mtandao wa IRC."

msgid "IRC networks outside I2P can also be reached if a SOCKS outproxy within I2P is known, though it depends on whether or not the outproxy has been blocked by the IRC network."
msgstr "Mitandao ya IRC nje ya I2P pia inaweza kufikiliwa kama outproxy ya SOCKS ndani ya I2P inajulikana, ingawa inategemea kama outproxy imezuiwa na mtandao wa IRC au haujazuiwa."

msgid "A basic server tunnel for hosting a generic service inside I2P."
msgstr "Tuneli ya msingi ya seva ya kuhosti huduma ya kawaida ndani ya I2P."

msgid "A server tunnel that is customised for HTTP connections."
msgstr "Tuneli ya seva iliyobadilishwa kwa ajili ya muunganisho wa HTTP."

msgid "Use this tunnel type if you want to host an eepsite."
msgstr "Tumia aina hii ya tuneli kama unataka kuhosti eepsite."

msgid "A customised server tunnel for hosting IRC networks inside I2P."
msgstr "Tuneli ya seva iliyobadilishwa kwa kuhosti mitandao ya IRC ndani ya I2P."

msgid "Usually, a separate tunnel needs to be created for each IRC server that is to be accessible inside I2P."
msgstr "Kwa kawaida, tuneli tofauti inahitajika kutengenezwa kwa kila seva ya IRC ambayo itapaswa kupatikana ndani ya I2P."

msgid "Select tunnel type"
msgstr "Chagua aina ya tuneli"

msgid "Choose a name and description for your tunnel."
msgstr "Chagua jina na maelezo kwa tuneli yako."

msgid "These can be anything you want - they are just for ease of identifying the tunnel in the routerconsole."
msgstr "Zinaweza kuwa chochote unavyotaka - zinatumika tu kwa kurahisi kutambua tuneli katika routerconsole."

msgid "If you know of any outproxies for this type of tunnel (either HTTP or SOCKS), fill them in below."
msgstr "Kama unajua kwa outproxy yoyote ya aina hii ya tuneli (ama ya HTTP au ya SOCKS), jaza hapa chini."

msgid "Separate multiple proxies with commas."
msgstr "Tenga proksi nyingi kwa koma."

msgid "List of I2P outproxy destinations, separated with commas (e.g. proxy1.i2p,proxy2.i2p)"
msgstr "Orodha ya malengo ya outproxy za I2P, yaliyotengwa kwa koma (k.m. proxy1.i2p,proxy2.i2p)"

msgid "Type in the I2P destination of the service that this client tunnel should connect to."
msgstr "Andika lengo la I2P la huduma ambayo tuneli hii ya mteja inapaswa kuunganisha."

msgid "This could be the full Base64 destination key, or an I2P URL from your address book."
msgstr "Hii inaweza kuwa ufafanuzi kamili wa lengo wa Base64, au URL ya I2P kutoka kitabu chenu cha anwani."

msgid "Enter a b64 or .i2p address here"
msgstr "Ingiza anwani ya b64 au .i2p hapa"

msgid "This is the IP that your service is running on, this is usually on the same machine so 127.0.0.1 is autofilled."
msgstr "Hii ndiyo IP ambayo huduma yako inafanya kazi, kwa kawaida iko kwenye mashine ileile kwa hivyo 127.0.0.1 imeweka kiotomatiki."

msgid "This is the port that the service is accepting connections on."
msgstr "Hii ndiyo bandari ambayo huduma inapokea muunganisho."

msgid "This is the port that the client tunnel will be accessed from locally."
msgstr "Hii ndiyo bandari ambayo tuneli ya mteja itafikiliwa kutoka ndani."

msgid "How do you want this tunnel to be accessed? By just this machine, your entire subnet, or external internet?"
msgstr "Ungependa tuneli hii ifikiliwe vipi? Na mashine hii pekee, mtandao wote wako, au mtandao wa nje?"

msgid "You will most likely want to just allow 127.0.0.1"
msgstr "Huenda ungependa kuruhusu tu 127.0.0.1"

msgid "The I2P router can automatically start this tunnel for you when the router is started."
msgstr "Routeri ya I2P inaweza kuanza tuneli hii kwa ajili yako kiotomatiki pale routeri inapozishwa."

msgid "This can be useful for frequently-used tunnels (especially server tunnels), but for tunnels that are only used occasionally it would mean that the I2P router is creating and maintaining unnecessary tunnels."
msgstr "Hii inaweza kuwa na manufaa kwa tuneli zinazotumika mara kwa mara (hasa tuneli za seva), lakini kwa tuneli zinazotumika mara chache tu itamaanisha kwamba routeri ya I2P inatengeneza na kudumisha tuneli zisizohitajika."

msgid "The wizard has now collected enough information to create your tunnel."
msgstr "Mwongoza sasa umekusanya taarifa za kutosha kutengeneza tuneli yako."

msgid "Upon clicking the Save button below, the wizard will set up the tunnel, and take you back to the main I2PTunnel page."
msgstr "Unapobofya kitufe cha Hifadhi hapa chini, mwongoza utaandaa tuneli, na kukuleta kurudi kwenye kurasa kuu ya I2PTunnel."

msgid "Because you chose to automatically start the tunnel when the router starts, you don't have to do anything further."
msgstr "Kwa sababu ulichagua kuanza tuneli kiotomatiki pale routeri inapozishwa, huna lazima ufanye chochote kingine."

msgid "The router will start the tunnel once it has been set up."
msgstr "Routeri itaanza tuneli mara tu itakapopoandaa."

msgid "Because you chose not to automatically start the tunnel, you will have to manually start it."
msgstr "Kwa sababu ulichagua kusiuanze tuneli kiotomatiki, lazima uianze mwa mkono."

msgid "You can do this by clicking the Start button on the main page which corresponds to the new tunnel."
msgstr "Unaweza kufanya hivi kwa kubofya kitufe cha Anza kwenye kurasa kuu inayolingana na tuneli mpya."

msgid "Below is a summary of the options you chose:"
msgstr "Hapa chini kuna muhtasari wa vichaguo ulivyochagua:"

msgid "Tunnel description"
msgstr "Maelezo ya tuneli"

msgid "Binding address"
msgstr "Anwani ya kujaza"

msgid "Tunnel port"
msgstr "Bandari ya tuneli"

msgid "Alongside these basic settings, there are a number of advanced options for tunnel configuration."
msgstr "Pamoja na mipangilio hii ya msingi, kuna chaguo nyingi za juu za sanidi ya tuneli."

msgid "The wizard will set reasonably sensible default values for these, but you can view and/or edit these by clicking on the tunnel's name in the main I2PTunnel page."
msgstr "Mwongoza utaweka thamani za default zinazofaa kwa hivi, lakini unaweza kuona na/au kuhariri kwa kubofya jina la tuneli kwenye kurasa kuu ya I2PTunnel."

msgid "Cancel the wizard and return to Tunnel Manager home page"
msgstr "Ghairi mwongoza na urudi kwenye ukurasa mkuu wa Msimamizi wa Tuneli"

msgid "Return to previous page"
msgstr "Rudi kwenye kurasa iliyotangulia"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Iliyotangulia"

msgid "Save tunnel configuration"
msgstr "Hifadhi mipangilio ya tuneli"

msgid "Save Tunnel"
msgstr "Hifadhi Tuneli"

msgid "Finish Wizard and review tunnel settings"
msgstr "Maliza mwongoza na pitia mipangilio ya tuneli"

msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Maliza"

msgid "Advance to next page"
msgstr "Endelea hadi ukurasa ujao"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Ifuatayo"
